  m_text: 'In this phase you will manually define the surface of your keyboard, on
    top of which the notes will appear.


    Use the trigger on your right controller
    to define a point.


    Once the three points are defined, you will see a handle
    on either side of the identified rectangle. You may push and pull them to resize
    your keyboard surface.


    Once you are satisfied with the defined keyboard
    surface, press the A button on your right controller once more to confirm your
    selection.'
